How well does it work?

39
00:02:05,169 --> 00:02:09,527
Across one hundred and forty-four injected
events on held-out simulation seeds,

40
00:02:09,587 --> 00:02:13,561
Canary detected eighty-eight point nine
percent, with ninety-two point three

41
00:02:13,621 --> 00:02:14,905
