46
00:02:28,223 --> 00:02:30,891
The next step is a shadow-mode pilot.

47
00:02:30,951 --> 00:02:35,438
Run Canary alongside existing processes,
agree on an alert budget, and measure

48
00:02:35,498 --> 00:02:38,894
